```java
public class CustomObjectSerializer extends StdSerializer<CustomObject> {
    public CustomObjectSerializer() {
        this(null);
    }

    public CustomObjectSerializer(Class<CustomObject> t) {
        super(t);
    }

    @Override
    public void serialize(
      CustomObject value, JsonGenerator jgen, SerializerProvider provider) 
      throws IOException, JsonProcessingException {

        jgen.writeStartObject();
        jgen.writeNumberField("id", value.getId());
        // Other fields...
        jgen.writeEndObject();
    }
}
```
Then, we need to register these serializers/deserializers with Jackson ObjectMapper:
```java
SimpleModule module = new SimpleModule();
